SUMMARY:The Neon Room at Helium: Ehsan Ahmad
LOCATION:Portland
DESCRIPTION:Ehsan Ahmad is an up and coming comedian that is on the verge o
 f blowing up (probably not the best use of words there).\n\nHe is a regular
  at the world famous Comedy Mothership\, has appeared on The Joe Rogan Expe
 rience and has been a guest on Kill Tony three times.\n\nHe also regularly 
 opens for some of the biggest names in comedy: Joe Rogan\, Duncan Trussell\
 , Tony Hinchcliffe\, Ron White\, Russell Peters\, Akaash Singh and many mor
 e.\n\nHis act manages to be silly\, edgy and brown all at the same time\, a
 nd it definitely finds the line and tries to push it as far as he can.\n\nM
 anagement reserves the right to prevent customers from entering the facilit
 y who they deem disruptive or dangerous to other patrons.\nMore info: https
 ://comedyatlas.app/comedy-atlas/event/the-neon-room-at-helium-ehsan-ahmad/
